cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use VisNavKit, please cite it as below, along with the paper any recipe adapts (see CITATION.bib)."
title: "VisNavKit: a composable toolkit for visual navigation policies"
abstract: >-
  VisNavKit composes visual navigation policies from interchangeable stages — vision, any number
  of input modalities, any number of goals, a temporal encoder and a trajectory decoder — then
  trains them, exports ONNX deployment graphs and benchmarks them open-loop.
type: software
authors:
